line 11, 12, 15, 16, 21, 22, 23, 24 extra: by-design spec §1.6 `+` adds two numbers or concatenates two strings, it never coerces the other operand
line 20 extra: by-design spec §1.6 `-x` on a string is rejected, write `-Number(x)`
line 27, 28 extra: by-design spec §1.6 `<`, `>`, `<=`, `>=` compare only two numbers or two strings
